  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p>과학시간에 아이들의 내면을 들여다 볼 기회가 별로 없다.</p><p>중간고사 끝나고 2단원 핵심단어를 이용하여 글을 써보라고 했더니 </p><p>남학생들임에도 불구하고 진지하게 열심히 한다!</p><p>한명한명 발표를 시켰더니 발표도 잘한다!</p><p>흐뭇~~~~</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/23444044572936DC3F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"638\" height=\"714\" style=\"width: 638px; height: 714px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20160503_111220.jpg\"  id=\"A_23444044572936DC3F5B44\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/227D2F44572936DF0A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"694\" height=\"868\" style=\"width: 694px; height: 868px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20160503_111231.jpg\"  id=\"A_227D2F44572936DF0A30B2\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/26025B44572936E10B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"675\" height=\"637\" style=\"width: 675px; height: 637px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20160503_111256.jpg\"  id=\"A_26025B44572936E10BF5F8\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/23208B44572936E501\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"651\" height=\"1024\" style=\"width: 651px; height: 1024px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20160503_111307.jpg\"  id=\"A_23208B44572936E501510A\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/22251044572936E80A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"625\" height=\"1024\" style=\"width: 625px; height: 1024px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20160503_111316.jpg\"  id=\"A_22251044572936E80ACEC3\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/264C8144572936EB08\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"642\" height=\"786\" style=\"width: 642px; height: 786px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"20160503_111440.jpg\"  id=\"A_264C8144572936EB087F20\"/></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
